      "text": "中转服务人员可以帮您确认，必要时会补发登机牌。",
      "source_hash": "cb60271233bb"
    },
    "48ef918f": {
      "text": "接下来有三道听力题。听相关对话，在解答前选出答案。",
      "source_hash": "93538b29bd11"
    },
    "2ff86fc5": {
      "text": "目前巴黎航班的登机口是哪一个？",
      "source_hash": "f80bd6d4b8cd"
    },
    "330542e9": {
      "text": "A. K17",
      "source_hash": "fea12fd70f69"
    },
    "87a7233d": {
      "text": "B. K5",
      "source_hash": "06500f533c3f"
    },
    "6a9dcd80": {
      "text": "C. K70",
      "source_hash": "d42429c39ba7"
    },
    "0489a3a5": {
      "text": "在这里。纸质登机牌上写的是K5登机口。",
      "source_hash": "4195dea582af"
    },
    "c45eef8b": {
      "text": "目前的显示屏显示K17。请以最新的登机口信息为准。",
      "source_hash": "3232aa0e6f36"
    },
    "478d20be": {
      "text": "现在选出你的答案。",
      "source_hash": "a5652ce999fa"
    },
    "bac30b1d": {
      "text": "正确答案是A。K17。",
      "source_hash": "2d8a5eded39b"
    },
    "08a93762": {
      "text": "登机时间是几点？",
      "source_hash": "423e76a60dca"
    },
    "af3a0fc4": {
      "text": "A. 三点三十分",
      "source_hash": "339e3ccd2ebd"
    },
    "8edf7951": {
      "text": "B. 五点十分",
      "source_hash": "9ece80b5be71"
    },
    "d34522d5": {
      "text": "C. 三点十分",
      "source_hash": "adba76bf5f1e"
    },
    "ffc3a681": {
      "text": "登机时间也改了吗？",
      "source_hash": "730cbdd39fcf"
    },
    "8a40f233": {
      "text": "还是三点十分。请预留时间前往新的登机口。",
      "source_hash": "1c949eda44fe"
    },
    "e17e5319": {
      "text": "现在选出你的答案。",
      "source_hash": "a5652ce999fa"
    },
    "a5cb911f": {
      "text": "正确答案是C。三点十分。",
      "source_hash": "d0f81e0572a2"
    },
    "3a76a281": {
      "text": "谁可以确认原来的登机牌是否仍然有效？",
      "source_hash": "f13a45ba99f8"
    },
    "aadd9c8e": {
      "text": "A. 酒店前台",
      "source_hash": "ad847e15db11"
    },
    "701efa52": {
      "text": "B. 中转服务人员",
      "source_hash": "b8ac7e4b39e7"
    },
    "40551eb0": {
      "text": "C. 出租车司机",
      "source_hash": "f11f3310ac88"
    },
    "249cc732": {
      "text": "我原来的登机牌还有效吗？",
      "source_hash": "69bc1abe7bf6"
    },
    "37d9449a": {
